{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_96_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"一、三十有三年，春，王二月，秦人入滑。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"滑，國也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"二、齊侯使國歸父來聘。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"三、夏，四月，辛巳，晉人及姜戎敗秦師於殽。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"不言戰而言敗何也？狄秦也。其狄之何也？秦越千里之險入虛國，進不能守，退敗其師徒，亂人子女之教，無男女之別。秦之為狄，自殽之戰始也。秦伯將襲鄭，百里子與蹇叔子諫曰：「千里而襲人，未有不亡者也。」秦伯曰：「子之冢木已拱矣，何知？」師行，百里子與蹇叔子送其子而戒之曰：「女死必於殽之巖唫之下。我將屍女於是。」師行，百里子與蹇叔子隨其子而哭之。秦伯怒曰：「何為哭吾師也？」二子曰：「非敢哭師也，哭吾子也。我老矣，彼不死則我死矣。」晉人與姜戎要而擊之殽，匹馬倚輪無反者。晉人者，晉子也。其曰人何也？微之也。何為微之？不正其釋殯而主乎戰也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"四、癸巳，葬晉文公。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"日葬，危不得葬也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"五、狄侵齊。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"六、公伐邾，取訾樓。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"七、秋，公子遂帥師伐邾。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"八、晉人敗狄於箕。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"九、冬，十月，公如齊。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"十、十有二月，公至自齊。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"十一、乙巳，公薨於小寢。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"小寢，非正也。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"十二、隕霜不殺草，李梅實。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"未可殺而殺，舉重也。可殺而不殺，舉輕也。實之為言猶實也。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_clt_96_18","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_96","textTraditional":"十三、晉人、陳人、鄭人伐許。","sentenceOrder":18}],"overrides":{}}